WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.320
This is unbelievably dangerous.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.160
To prevent potential disasters, I'm announcing today

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.240
that my administration will lead an international effort

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.720
to enforce biological weapons conventions.

